<h3 class="pub-findings-header ">CPI sub-indices</h3>
<p>Tables 4 to 16 detail all ECOICOP sub-indices of the CPI.</p>
<p>Table 2 and Table 18 detail selected consumer price index sub-indices. The sub index for Services rose by 4.1% in the year to July, while Goods increased by 2.5%. Services, excluding mortgage interest repayments, increased by 3.8% in the year since July 2025.</p>
<p>The CPI excluding tobacco increased by 0.1% in the month of July and rose by 3.3% in the year. The CPI excluding mortgage interest remained unchanged in the month and climbed by 3.2% in the year.</p>
