<h3 class="pub-findings-header ">National Average Price</h3>
<p>National Average Prices for selected goods and services for July 2026 are detailed in Table 21.</p>
<p>Looking at the National Average Prices of some staple items:</p>
<ul>
<li>The national average price for bread (large (800g) white sliced pan) was unchanged in the year to July 2026, while the same size brown sliced pan decreased by 2 cents in the year.</li>
<li>The national average price of 1kg of sirloin steak fell by 5 cents in the year, while the average price for 2.5kg of potatoes was down by 9 cents.</li>
<li>The national average price of full fat milk per 2 litres was down 9 cents in the year, while butter per lb fell by 55 cents and the average price of Irish cheddar per kg decreased by 9 cents.</li>
<li>The national average price of a take-home 50cl can of lager at &euro;2.40 was down 3 cents compared to July 2025, while a take-home 50cl can of cider at &euro;2.72 was up 2 cents.</li>
<li>In July 2026, the national average price of a pint of stout in licensed premises was &euro;6.33, up 27 cents in the year, while a pint of lager was &euro;6.75, up 25 cents compared with July 2025.</li>
<li>The national average price for a litre of diesel in July 2026 was &euro;1.76, an increase of 6 cents on the same time last year. Petrol prices increased by 5 cents to &euro;1.77 a litre.</li>
</ul>
<div class="prices-mini-viz">
    <header>
